WEBVTT

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.620
Both today and tomorrow, I've got time to kick back.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.620
kyou mo ashita mo HIMAKKUSU

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
My family of four and I are going to stay the night.

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
gokazoku yonin de goippaku

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
Put on an Egyptian front and become a sphinx,

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
EGIPUTO kidori de SUFINKUSU

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
and for an American feeling, Texas!

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
AMERICA kibun de TEXAS

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
When you're sitting pretty, with enough and to spare,

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
yoyuu SHAKUSHAKUPPE itsumo

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
and yet you always shilly-shally,

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
funya funya de iruto

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:39.970
and your bitter face and bitter feelings both teeter-totter,

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:39.970
nigamushi hara no mushi nahe nahe to

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
it's time to get out of there!

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
tettai shichau yo

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.690
I am feeling Ultra Relax,

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.690
watashi ha URUTORA RIRAKKUSU

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.900
a wonderful, invincible Relax.

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.900
SUTEKI ni muteki na RIRAKKUSU

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.860
A one-step-above kind of Deluxe.

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.860
hito aji chigau ze DERAKKUSU

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:54.070
I may be a little jumbled,

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:54.070
toccharakatte mo

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:55.820
but when I'm called on, ba-ba-ba-ba-bang!

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:55.820
yobarerya PAPAPAPAAAN!

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:58.910
I always feel Relax,

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:58.910
watashi ha itsudemo RIRAKKUSU

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.910
a humble, simple, sort of Deluxe.

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.910
WABISABI kikasete DERAKKUSU

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
Bright! Clear! Alert-headed, peep-peep!

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
BIKKARI! KIKKARI! saeteru ATAMA PII! PII!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.960
Keep your eyes on me, okay?!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.960
watashi no KOTO dake mitete ne!

00:01:33.320 --> 00:01:36.780
I am Kurata Sana. A first year
junior high school student.

00:01:36.780 --> 00:01:40.240
My manager and driver, Rei-kun.

00:01:40.240 --> 00:01:43.750
Aoki-award winning writer, Mama
and the squirrel, Maro-chan.

00:01:43.750 --> 00:01:46.210
The mysterious white bat, Babbit.

00:01:46.210 --> 00:01:48.290
Happy New Year!

00:01:48.290 --> 00:01:53.170
Hayama Akito, my good friend. Anyway, let's leave him be.

00:01:54.130 --> 00:01:58.590
Fan Comes to Visit
First Thing in the New Year

00:02:12.520 --> 00:02:15.690
Happy New Year!

00:02:16.860 --> 00:02:20.820
Apparently, you have to make your
wish realistic so that it will come true.

00:02:20.820 --> 00:02:22.870
Eh? Realistic?

00:02:22.870 --> 00:02:24.580
Right! Realistic!

00:02:24.580 --> 00:02:27.000
Mom's Wish

00:02:24.620 --> 00:02:27.250
Let's hear what Mom's wish is first.

00:02:28.120 --> 00:02:29.580
Onda! It's finished.

00:02:29.580 --> 00:02:31.170
Thank you so much, Sensei.

00:02:31.170 --> 00:02:34.840
I'll write novels nonstop at
a super-human speed.

00:02:34.840 --> 00:02:37.880
I'll work really hard and super fast.

00:02:38.130 --> 00:02:40.510
Definitely a very realistic wish...

00:02:40.510 --> 00:02:43.550
I can't believe my usually lazy
Mama would wish for something like this.

00:02:43.550 --> 00:02:45.810
Yosh! Finally finished.

00:02:45.810 --> 00:02:49.730
What? Kurata-sensei still hasn't
finished most of her new novel?

00:02:49.730 --> 00:02:51.480
- Sensei!
- Let's celebrate!

00:02:51.480 --> 00:02:54.190
Let's take this opportunity to
have a trip abroad.

00:02:56.320 --> 00:03:00.150
Sensei! The manuscript hasn't
finished yet! Come back!

00:03:01.110 --> 00:03:03.870
Blue sky... Green sea...

00:03:03.870 --> 00:03:06.370
An around-the-world trip
away from the rest of the world...

00:03:06.370 --> 00:03:10.670
I will be cruising on a luxurious
ship...

00:03:13.790 --> 00:03:17.340
Beautiful madam. Would you like
a cocktail drink?

00:03:17.340 --> 00:03:19.220
Ah, thank you.

00:03:19.970 --> 00:03:23.390
Beautiful madam. Would you like
a plate of Indian curry?

00:03:23.390 --> 00:03:24.850
Ah, looks tasty.

00:03:25.050 --> 00:03:26.060
Beautiful madam...

00:03:26.060 --> 00:03:29.230
Gentlemen from all over the world
will come to chat me up...

00:03:30.480 --> 00:03:32.730
So this was Mama's real wish...

00:03:35.310 --> 00:03:37.280
Misako... Misako... Misako...

00:03:37.280 --> 00:03:39.900
What do you think?
My realistic wish...

00:03:39.900 --> 00:03:42.910
Now let me hear yours.

00:03:43.200 --> 00:03:45.160
I like the normal Mama better.

00:03:45.160 --> 00:03:46.780
My wish...

00:03:46.740 --> 00:03:48.700
Rei-kun's Wish

00:03:46.780 --> 00:03:48.750
Now listen to Rei-kun's wish!

00:03:51.460 --> 00:03:53.620
Sana-chan,
after the shooting in London...

00:03:53.620 --> 00:03:55.170
We have photo shoots in Paris and Spain.

00:03:55.170 --> 00:03:59.460
Then we go to HK for an interview, and
to Antarctica to take photos with penguins.

00:03:59.460 --> 00:04:03.050
Rei-kun, sometimes I want to stay
in Japan and just relax for a while.

00:04:03.050 --> 00:04:07.010
Right now we can't do it. Next year
you've three films to shoot in Hollywood.

00:04:07.390 --> 00:04:08.680
Rei...

00:04:08.680 --> 00:04:10.270
That's Asako-san's voice.

00:04:12.640 --> 00:04:14.600
That's dangerous!

00:04:14.850 --> 00:04:16.110
Rei...

00:04:18.520 --> 00:04:22.110
Don't leave me!
Let's get married right now.

00:04:22.110 --> 00:04:24.450
See, I even have the ring ready.

00:04:24.450 --> 00:04:25.990
Asako...

00:04:25.990 --> 00:04:29.620
I'm sorry! Right now I have to go
with Sana-chan to a shoot in London.

00:04:29.620 --> 00:04:32.710
After that I will come right
back to be with you.

00:04:32.710 --> 00:04:33.960
Is that so...

00:04:34.870 --> 00:04:36.920
I'll wait for you forever...

00:04:37.290 --> 00:04:39.340
Rei...

00:04:39.800 --> 00:04:42.630
I haven't heard from Asako at all
since the end of year.

00:04:42.630 --> 00:04:47.350
When I called her agency,
they said she was on vacation.

00:04:47.350 --> 00:04:50.600
I didn't hear anything about her
going on a vacation.

00:04:50.600 --> 00:04:53.140
Does she have a new boyfriend?

00:04:53.140 --> 00:04:54.770
No way.

00:04:55.100 --> 00:04:56.900
It's possible.

00:04:56.900 --> 00:04:58.770
Sana? Have you made your wish yet?

00:04:58.770 --> 00:05:02.610
I haven't got anything to wish for.
I'm satisfied with how things are right now.

00:05:02.610 --> 00:05:03.740
Is that so?

00:05:03.740 --> 00:05:07.700
Mama, Rei-kun, and Shimura-san are
all healthy, and we have the house.

00:05:07.700 --> 00:05:11.160
This is heaven compared to how it
was last year.

00:05:12.410 --> 00:05:15.580
Eh... the queue is really long...
So can you...

00:05:17.420 --> 00:05:21.000
Can you please hurry up?

00:05:21.460 --> 00:05:23.630
Sana-chan, hurry up and make a wish.

00:05:23.630 --> 00:05:25.630
Okay! Let's see...

00:05:25.630 --> 00:05:27.680
Sana's wish is...

00:05:25.680 --> 00:05:27.640
Sana's Wish

00:05:30.470 --> 00:05:34.850
So... my New Year's wish is...

00:05:37.900 --> 00:05:39.270
Daifukumochi (a sweet dumpling
with bean paste in it).

00:05:39.270 --> 00:05:40.820
Why is it Daifuku?

00:05:40.820 --> 00:05:43.990
Now that we've all made our wishes,
let's go eat Takoyaki. (squid dumpling)

00:05:43.990 --> 00:05:46.490
Wait, Mama! My wish is still at
the Daifuku stage...

00:05:47.660 --> 00:05:49.620
Even though I made a weird wish to
the gods...

00:05:49.620 --> 00:05:53.410
...I hope you can tell them that I
wish this year goes as well as last year.

00:05:55.710 --> 00:05:59.750
A new year... Sana getting banned
by the media last year is already an old story.

00:05:59.750 --> 00:06:04.210
So my name will not show on TV or
magazines.

00:06:04.590 --> 00:06:08.930
No one will care if I disappear
from Show Biz.

00:06:08.930 --> 00:06:10.430
That's not true!

00:06:10.430 --> 00:06:14.060
Kurata Sana has always been
the treasure of Show Biz.

00:06:14.060 --> 00:06:17.140
But, no one seems to notice her.

00:06:17.390 --> 00:06:21.110
If because of that guy's drama
I have to repeat a year,

00:06:21.110 --> 00:06:23.860
it would be really embarrassing.

00:06:24.150 --> 00:06:25.740
It will be very embarrassing.

00:06:25.740 --> 00:06:27.280
Che! Didn't get it.

00:06:27.820 --> 00:06:30.990
But if you're happy with how it is
then it's fine, right?

00:06:30.990 --> 00:06:32.450
That's true.

00:06:33.620 --> 00:06:35.580
Kyaa! Didn't get it.

00:06:35.870 --> 00:06:40.750
Sensei, is Sana-chan really going
to drop out of Show Biz?

00:06:40.750 --> 00:06:44.460
Well, Sana has always been lucky
in terms of work.

00:06:44.460 --> 00:06:47.170
So her desire and
seriousness in work...

00:06:47.170 --> 00:06:48.670
...is really low.

00:06:50.220 --> 00:06:52.800
Why is this?
No matter how I throw, I can't get it.

00:06:53.220 --> 00:06:56.020
Being so serious in games isn't
going to work.

00:06:56.810 --> 00:06:57.850
Hi, this is Sagami.

00:06:57.850 --> 00:06:59.770
Rei! Happy New Year!

00:06:59.770 --> 00:07:00.730
Asako!

00:07:00.730 --> 00:07:03.270
Asako is back!

00:07:00.770 --> 00:07:05.730
Asako is back

00:07:03.270 --> 00:07:05.730
Where did she go?
Seems strange!

00:07:05.730 --> 00:07:07.740
Of course it was Hawaii!

00:07:07.740 --> 00:07:10.360
Didn't you see
the interview on TV?

00:07:10.360 --> 00:07:14.910
Because Sana-chan got banned by the media, all the other news got mashed together.

00:07:12.240 --> 00:07:14.910
Oh! Presents from Hawaii!

00:07:14.910 --> 00:07:16.620
These sunglasses too.

00:07:16.830 --> 00:07:19.370
So, did you have fun in Hawaii?

00:07:19.370 --> 00:07:22.710
To tell the truth, it was annoying.

00:07:23.540 --> 00:07:26.300
Aloha... Hawaii...

00:07:26.710 --> 00:07:30.970
Japanese actors and actresses are
all over Hawaii for New Year's.

00:07:31.340 --> 00:07:35.220
It's exactly the same as it is here.

00:07:36.180 --> 00:07:38.180
I got annoyed
so I came back earlier.

00:07:38.180 --> 00:07:40.770
God will punish you for saying
a thing like this!

00:07:40.770 --> 00:07:42.190
If Sana-chan hears this...

00:07:42.480 --> 00:07:45.270
All you think about is Sana-chan,
Sana-chan!

00:07:45.270 --> 00:07:47.070
I have my troubles too.

00:07:49.150 --> 00:07:52.150
I've been working so hard.

00:07:52.150 --> 00:07:55.740
Finally everyone thinks that I am
a good actress.

00:07:56.120 --> 00:07:59.410
But I want to be an actress for
the rest of my life.

00:07:59.410 --> 00:08:02.500
Even when I'm 60 or 80 years old...

00:08:02.500 --> 00:08:05.290
I still want to be Kurumi Asako the actress.

00:08:06.790 --> 00:08:09.300
In order to do that I can't stay
this way.

00:08:09.710 --> 00:08:12.880
I want to go to London and learn
more about acting.

00:08:13.680 --> 00:08:15.140
London?

00:08:18.310 --> 00:08:20.520
Will you come with me?

00:08:21.560 --> 00:08:24.440
- What's wrong?
- I...

00:08:28.320 --> 00:08:33.530
I thought you were going to leave
me again. I was worried.

00:08:33.530 --> 00:08:35.740
What are you talking about?

00:08:36.490 --> 00:08:38.410
Rei! Don't be silly!

00:08:38.410 --> 00:08:40.620
What made you think that?

00:08:42.160 --> 00:08:43.660
I'm sorry.

00:08:44.460 --> 00:08:47.500
You will come with me
to London, right?

00:08:47.500 --> 00:08:48.790
Yeah.

00:08:51.710 --> 00:08:53.130
Thanks for having me over.

00:08:53.130 --> 00:08:55.180
Hayama! What's up?

00:08:55.180 --> 00:08:57.180
It's my father...

00:08:57.430 --> 00:08:59.510
Oh! Your dad came too.

00:08:59.510 --> 00:09:02.730
Well... right now he's on the roof.

00:09:04.390 --> 00:09:08.480
Sana-chan and Sana-chan's Mom.
Happy New Year.

00:09:08.480 --> 00:09:10.690
I hope this year will be great too.

00:09:11.070 --> 00:09:13.070
Ah! That's Hayama's father.

00:09:13.070 --> 00:09:15.070
Happy New Year.

00:09:15.070 --> 00:09:17.910
Why do you run up to people's roof
on New Year's day, Father Hayama?

00:09:18.160 --> 00:09:20.830
It's no use just waiting outside anyway...

00:09:20.830 --> 00:09:24.410
so I thought I would help by
shoveling the snow on the roof.

00:09:24.410 --> 00:09:27.830
But I didn't think I would slip...
Hahaha.

00:09:28.210 --> 00:09:29.540
Sorry, Akito...

00:09:29.540 --> 00:09:31.670
Can you help me down?

00:09:33.460 --> 00:09:37.180
Sana-chan, how is your work going?

00:09:37.550 --> 00:09:41.180
Haven't seen you on TV for a while.
It feels like something is missing.

00:09:41.850 --> 00:09:44.020
A lot has happened...

00:09:44.020 --> 00:09:47.850
It seems that you have gone
through a lot of troubles because of Akito.

00:09:48.100 --> 00:09:51.270
Being banned by the media was
because of Akito...

00:09:51.520 --> 00:09:55.190
No! It had nothing to do
with Hayama.

00:09:58.280 --> 00:10:00.070
I haven't studied for a long time.

00:10:00.070 --> 00:10:02.660
So now I can use this chance to
study more.

00:10:02.660 --> 00:10:03.620
Is that so?

00:10:03.620 --> 00:10:06.410
There are a lot of letters this
morning.

00:10:06.410 --> 00:10:07.620
Shimura-san?

00:10:07.960 --> 00:10:10.290
Is that so?! I am relieved.

00:10:10.290 --> 00:10:11.590
That's good.

00:10:11.710 --> 00:10:13.300
Found it. Our keys.

00:10:13.300 --> 00:10:16.260
You found it. Great.

00:10:18.760 --> 00:10:22.680
Thank god I didn't confess my love
to him on Christmas Eve.

00:10:23.430 --> 00:10:25.100
If I had confessed then...

00:10:25.100 --> 00:10:27.310
Everything would be a mess.

00:10:27.310 --> 00:10:29.650
It would be embarrassing to see
each other.

00:10:30.310 --> 00:10:31.610
New Year.

00:10:31.730 --> 00:10:33.650
Bye!

00:10:35.150 --> 00:10:38.110
Hayama-kun has really grown a lot.

00:10:39.990 --> 00:10:42.830
Right. Definitely.

00:10:44.240 --> 00:10:46.540
I see, under the letters are
clothes.

00:10:46.540 --> 00:10:47.960
Just like sauce covering rice.

00:10:47.960 --> 00:10:49.710
Shimura-san, this is a neat trick.

00:10:49.710 --> 00:10:53.340
Don't be like this.
Soon there will be tons of letters.

00:10:53.500 --> 00:10:58.970
Block the under
stratum up

00:10:53.500 --> 00:10:57.720
Block the under stratum up on
purpose that it'll look like more things on it.

00:10:57.720 --> 00:10:59.220
This is a small wisdom in life!

00:10:59.220 --> 00:11:00.550
This is for Mama.

00:11:00.550 --> 00:11:02.760
This is direct mail for bargain
sales.

00:11:02.760 --> 00:11:04.310
Oh, this is for me.

00:11:05.060 --> 00:11:06.640
Kurata Sana-sama.

00:11:06.640 --> 00:11:07.930
It's a record mail!

00:11:08.230 --> 00:11:11.270
I haven't been
totally forgotten yet.

00:11:11.270 --> 00:11:14.320
Sana-chan... help... Eh?

00:11:14.770 --> 00:11:19.900
Sana-chan, help me!

00:11:17.070 --> 00:11:19.900
What... What is this?

00:11:20.530 --> 00:11:31.540
{parte b}

00:11:31.580 --> 00:11:34.670
Babiley Group,
Ukulele

00:11:35.090 --> 00:11:41.300
New year day, sleep in the morning,
sleep in the evening.

00:11:41.300 --> 00:11:44.970
New year day, sleep all day.

00:11:44.970 --> 00:11:48.470
New year day is over when you
wake up.

00:11:48.470 --> 00:11:55.020
Isn't it good? Isn't it good?

00:11:55.020 --> 00:11:58.440
Isn't it great if life is like
that too?

00:11:59.940 --> 00:12:01.450
London... London!

00:12:01.450 --> 00:12:05.740
London, London, London!

00:12:05.740 --> 00:12:07.620
Go to London with Asako...

00:12:07.620 --> 00:12:09.580
Rei-kun and Asako go to London.

00:12:09.580 --> 00:12:10.830
Rei-kun!

00:12:11.910 --> 00:12:16.380
Sana-chan... Help...

00:12:15.210 --> 00:12:16.670
What is this?

00:12:16.670 --> 00:12:19.420
Why would someone send such a gloomy mail on New Year's day?

00:12:19.420 --> 00:12:21.720
Who is asking me for help?

00:12:21.970 --> 00:12:24.430
The return address is definitely
around here.

00:12:24.430 --> 00:12:27.390
But the street address isn't clear,
and there's no name, right?

00:12:27.390 --> 00:12:28.890
Yeah, there's none.

00:12:28.890 --> 00:12:30.640
Then it's
nearly impossible to find.

00:12:30.640 --> 00:12:32.640
Wait a second...

00:12:33.310 --> 00:12:38.020
Sana-chan... Help...

00:12:36.060 --> 00:12:40.780
Apart from the message there are
sounds like Ka-kong and dogs barking.

00:12:40.780 --> 00:12:42.110
The dog is a saluki.

00:12:42.110 --> 00:12:44.360
You can tell that much from
a record mail?

00:12:44.360 --> 00:12:46.660
Ka-kong and a Saluki dog...

00:12:46.660 --> 00:12:48.280
It's still very vague.

00:12:48.280 --> 00:12:50.120
Aren't there other hints?

00:12:50.120 --> 00:12:52.330
Hmm... Apart from those...

00:12:52.330 --> 00:12:53.620
Oh, wait, this...

00:12:53.620 --> 00:12:57.000
Rei-kun, what do you think the
initials F.C. stand for?

00:12:57.210 --> 00:13:01.380
FC... FC... FC...

00:13:02.210 --> 00:13:03.840
It's not foot candle, is it?

00:13:03.840 --> 00:13:08.970
F.C is unit of photic lum.

00:13:08.970 --> 00:13:10.720
If it is, it's almost right.

00:13:11.020 --> 00:13:13.890
I know! It stands for Fan Club!

00:13:13.890 --> 00:13:15.690
In another words...

00:13:15.690 --> 00:13:19.360
F.C. this way. F.C. street.

00:13:19.360 --> 00:13:20.860
It's written clearly!

00:13:25.110 --> 00:13:27.780
Saluki's barking,
and sounds like Ka-kong.

00:13:27.780 --> 00:13:31.910
F.C. 's banner. It has to be here.

00:13:31.910 --> 00:13:33.200
Definitely.

00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:34.910
It's clearly here.

00:13:35.330 --> 00:13:36.870
Hello!

00:13:40.380 --> 00:13:42.800
Anyone home?!

00:13:42.800 --> 00:13:44.880
Who's... there...?

00:13:45.260 --> 00:13:47.380
This is not a samurai film!

00:13:47.800 --> 00:13:50.180
Excuse me, anyone home?

00:13:51.720 --> 00:13:53.640
There, Rei-kun,
the FC mark.

00:13:53.640 --> 00:13:54.890
Clearly so.

00:13:55.520 --> 00:13:56.770
Surely.

00:13:56.770 --> 00:13:59.860
Excuse me, anyone home?

00:14:03.190 --> 00:14:04.740
You're really here.

00:14:04.740 --> 00:14:05.990
Record mail and...

00:14:05.990 --> 00:14:07.400
That voice from before.

00:14:07.400 --> 00:14:12.080
Welcome. Thank you for especially
coming here.

00:14:12.080 --> 00:14:14.200
I am a little embarrassed.

00:14:14.200 --> 00:14:15.700
Are you really embarrassed?

00:14:15.700 --> 00:14:17.250
You surprised us big time!

00:14:17.250 --> 00:14:19.080
Did you send this record mail?

00:14:19.080 --> 00:14:21.040
Yes, I did.

00:14:21.040 --> 00:14:23.840
I am Kurata Sana's
Fan Club leader.

00:14:23.840 --> 00:14:25.090
My name is Chidosei.

00:14:25.090 --> 00:14:27.300
Fan Club? Mine?

00:14:27.670 --> 00:14:30.430
Sorry we established it all
on our own.

00:14:30.430 --> 00:14:33.140
So I have a fan club too?

00:14:33.470 --> 00:14:38.390
I cannot believe that Sana-chan
would actually come.

00:14:38.390 --> 00:14:41.770
To get an emergency record mail
like that.

00:14:41.770 --> 00:14:43.520
Anyone would be surprised.

00:14:43.520 --> 00:14:45.860
Don't joke around like that.

00:14:46.280 --> 00:14:48.280
I am really sorry.

00:14:48.280 --> 00:14:50.780
But it was never meant
to be a joke.

00:14:51.450 --> 00:14:53.870
This is a small place,
but please come in.

00:14:53.870 --> 00:14:56.040
At least you should treat me
with tangerines.

00:14:56.040 --> 00:14:57.450
Don't be so shameless.

00:14:58.580 --> 00:14:59.960
Please come in.

00:15:01.670 --> 00:15:04.880
I haven't seen so many flashes in a long time. They are hurting my eyes, Rei-kun!

00:15:06.960 --> 00:15:08.380
This is superb!

00:15:09.090 --> 00:15:11.760
How memorable!
Do you remember this, Rei-kun?

00:15:11.760 --> 00:15:13.050
I wonder if
I can still fit into it.

00:15:13.050 --> 00:15:15.060
That costume from the
toothpaste commercial.

00:15:15.060 --> 00:15:17.060
Where did you get this stuff from?

00:15:17.060 --> 00:15:18.680
Special routes.

00:15:19.310 --> 00:15:22.310
This is the video of the first
episode of Kodocha.

00:15:22.310 --> 00:15:23.230
Wow! Amazing!

00:15:23.230 --> 00:15:26.480
Of course, we taped every single
episode of Kodocha.

00:15:26.480 --> 00:15:29.360
You even recorded the news.

00:15:29.360 --> 00:15:32.950
Our fan club members recorded every show that has Sana-chan in it.

00:15:32.950 --> 00:15:35.660
No matter how big your part is,
we would always check.

00:15:35.660 --> 00:15:40.040
But since the end of last year
there hasn't been anything for us to tape...

00:15:41.500 --> 00:15:43.210
Eh... Well...

00:15:44.460 --> 00:15:47.130
this really is troublesome.

00:15:47.800 --> 00:15:51.180
From that banned from show biz incident...

00:15:51.180 --> 00:15:55.010
the media kept on saying you
were selfish and big headed...

00:15:55.010 --> 00:15:57.930
but those are all lies, right?

00:15:58.270 --> 00:16:00.930
Well, how should I put it...

00:16:01.350 --> 00:16:04.900
All of us,
as well as Zenjiro-san...

00:16:04.900 --> 00:16:08.440
...really liked the child-like
and natural Sana-chan.

00:16:08.440 --> 00:16:12.950
Things we could not do,
you did enthusiastically.

00:16:13.660 --> 00:16:17.490
But now you lost because of all
these adults...

00:16:17.490 --> 00:16:21.500
...and are quitting show biz,
we're really upset.

00:16:23.290 --> 00:16:26.340
Of course, those are all only
rumors.

00:16:26.340 --> 00:16:29.210
So, now is just a resting period,
right?

00:16:29.210 --> 00:16:33.590
We were just discussing whether we would be able to see Sana-chan's great acting skills

00:16:33.590 --> 00:16:35.010
like she did in the last movie.

00:16:35.010 --> 00:16:37.680
Yes, there are a few great
opportunities we're thinking of.

00:16:37.680 --> 00:16:40.350
But Sana-chan was really busy
before...

00:16:40.350 --> 00:16:42.940
...so we're going to choose her
jobs more carefully now...

00:16:42.940 --> 00:16:44.100
Rei-kun!

00:16:45.100 --> 00:16:47.400
Don't lie anymore.

00:16:47.520 --> 00:16:48.940
Sana-chan...

00:16:49.480 --> 00:16:53.700
Right now, I cannot fulfill
everyone's expectations.

00:16:54.860 --> 00:16:56.200
I'm sorry.

00:16:57.700 --> 00:16:58.950
Sana-chan.

00:17:02.120 --> 00:17:05.790
Next time, no matter if it's TV shows or films, please work hard on it!

00:17:05.790 --> 00:17:07.670
Please work hard on it.

00:17:08.960 --> 00:17:11.460
- Sana-chan...
- Sana-chan...

00:17:11.460 --> 00:17:13.630
Sana-chan!

00:17:15.970 --> 00:17:19.050
Is work going okay?

00:17:19.300 --> 00:17:22.310
Soon there will be tons of
letters coming.

00:17:29.270 --> 00:17:30.770
Sana-chan.

00:17:31.480 --> 00:17:35.900
How come those kids
cared about me so much?

00:17:36.530 --> 00:17:39.370
That's because they like Sana-chan a lot.

00:17:39.740 --> 00:17:44.290
Even if I'm bad at math, got banned by the media, no work on hand, they still like me?

00:17:44.290 --> 00:17:47.870
That's right.
That's the Sana-chan they like.

00:17:48.250 --> 00:17:50.540
I'm like them, so I understand.

00:18:01.350 --> 00:18:02.930
Excuse me!

00:18:02.930 --> 00:18:03.970
Enemy.

00:18:03.970 --> 00:18:06.440
He's the sinner
who put up a job on Sana.

00:18:04.140 --> 00:18:06.560
Enemy

00:18:06.600 --> 00:18:07.810
Flashback!

00:18:20.870 --> 00:18:22.200
Cut! Cut!

00:18:35.630 --> 00:18:37.050
Terrible! All because of you!

00:18:53.190 --> 00:18:54.900
Back then, why did you...

00:18:55.480 --> 00:18:57.190
Back then, why did you...

00:18:57.190 --> 00:19:00.530
Why did you reject that line with
'devil' so much?

00:19:01.490 --> 00:19:03.830
I've been thinking about it since.

00:19:05.620 --> 00:19:08.330
In order for the story to become
coherent...

00:19:08.330 --> 00:19:11.170
I had no choice
but to use that line.

00:19:11.750 --> 00:19:16.340
But still, the story was not
coherent.

00:19:17.630 --> 00:19:19.970
I never thought that the line with 'devil'...

00:19:19.970 --> 00:19:22.430
...really sounded too harsh.

00:19:22.430 --> 00:19:24.010
I panicked.

00:19:25.060 --> 00:19:28.310
No matter how hard I tried, I
couldn't write the script for the last scene.

00:19:28.310 --> 00:19:32.060
In the end, I handed in the script
completely dissatisfied.

00:19:32.060 --> 00:19:35.320
Never making that line coherent
with the rest of the story.

00:19:36.150 --> 00:19:38.280
That's the first time I remembered.

00:19:38.940 --> 00:19:42.070
How come you could never say that
line?

00:19:42.070 --> 00:19:44.530
I wanted to
hear your thoughts once more.

00:19:45.490 --> 00:19:50.160
Then, at the wrap up party for
the show I learned the truth.

00:19:51.210 --> 00:19:52.670
It's Naozumi-kun!

00:19:53.250 --> 00:19:56.880
You were right.

00:19:58.800 --> 00:20:00.970
It's too late to say this now.

00:20:00.970 --> 00:20:03.010
Why don't you say it out loud?

00:20:03.010 --> 00:20:06.720
Back then I didn't bother to
listen to your opinion.

00:20:06.720 --> 00:20:08.560
I feel really ashamed.

00:20:08.560 --> 00:20:12.060
Well, let's not talk about things
in the past now.

00:20:12.060 --> 00:20:14.440
The main point is,
you remembered me.

00:20:14.440 --> 00:20:16.860
And you changed your opinion
about me.

00:20:16.860 --> 00:20:18.320
I am really happy already.

00:20:18.320 --> 00:20:21.950
Actually, I came today to discuss
a job opportunity with you.

00:20:23.070 --> 00:20:25.160
Really? Is that so?

00:20:25.160 --> 00:20:28.540
Is it a TV drama? Commercial? Film? Or is it Theatre?

00:20:28.540 --> 00:20:30.870
It's Math Teacher on Video.

00:20:33.750 --> 00:20:37.960
Kids learn math through these
videos.

00:20:37.960 --> 00:20:40.460
In other words,
they're educational videos.

00:20:40.460 --> 00:20:43.430
It's... math?

00:20:44.220 --> 00:20:48.180
An old friend asked me to
talk to you. I worked on it a little too.

00:20:48.180 --> 00:20:51.180
Right now we are looking for
the cast.

00:20:51.180 --> 00:20:54.140
Because it's just a video,
the budget is low.

00:20:54.140 --> 00:20:58.320
It's probably an insult to someone
as experienced as Sana-chan.

00:20:58.860 --> 00:21:01.400
But it isn't bad job either.

00:21:01.780 --> 00:21:03.860
Then, what will my part be?

00:21:03.860 --> 00:21:05.530
The math teacher.

00:21:05.950 --> 00:21:11.540
Sorry, but that's impossible.
God hasn't given me any brain cells for math.

00:21:11.540 --> 00:21:13.290
Sana-chan's suffocating!

00:21:14.160 --> 00:21:18.670
There'll be a script. You just need
to act like you do in a TV drama.

00:21:18.670 --> 00:21:22.920
Also, kids won't improve their
grades after watching right away.

00:21:23.170 --> 00:21:26.090
Only a video?!

00:21:26.090 --> 00:21:28.800
After all, Sana-chan is a Broadway star...

00:21:28.800 --> 00:21:32.640
Excuse me, these are the Daifuku
mochi our guest brought.

00:21:32.640 --> 00:21:34.520
I walked by a mochi store before
I came here.

00:21:34.520 --> 00:21:36.440
They looked so good,
so I bought them.

00:21:38.560 --> 00:21:39.940
Daifuku mochi...

00:21:49.700 --> 00:21:51.370
Rei-kun...

00:21:51.370 --> 00:21:55.540
I want to give this job a try.

00:21:56.120 --> 00:21:57.290
Catch!

00:21:57.290 --> 00:22:00.590
I don't know if I am suited for the job but I want to try it out.

00:22:00.590 --> 00:22:01.590
Really?

00:22:01.590 --> 00:22:04.460
Because of the Daifuku mochi
Mizuguchi-san brought.

00:22:04.460 --> 00:22:06.420
You agreed because of Daifuku
mochi?

00:22:06.420 --> 00:22:08.800
Sana-chan, you should think this
over more carefully!

00:22:08.800 --> 00:22:11.970
I will be the math teacher in the
video.

00:22:11.970 --> 00:22:13.520
Thank you for casting me.

00:22:13.520 --> 00:22:15.850
Shooting will start in a week's time.

00:22:15.850 --> 00:22:18.600
Staff will contact you about
the details.

00:22:19.190 --> 00:22:21.270
Thank you so much for helping me.

00:22:21.270 --> 00:22:23.980
Wait a second... wait a second...

00:22:24.730 --> 00:22:29.410
Not good, not good. Sana-chan is
suddenly coming back to show biz.

00:22:29.410 --> 00:22:33.620
Fan Club swears to support
Sana-chan forever.

